Cell["2. Matching", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"ccc9e0cc-ee0d-9b47-a600-ea7add2ed7e7"],

Cell["\<\
Before anything is rewritten, the input has to be found. \
HypergraphRuleMatches gives the ways it sits inside a hypergraph, and nothing \
else:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f6306a41-a781-e94d-94a3-2be46db5aa33"],

