vertex of each disappears with them:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c0982b39-0def-d242-822b-214aff925ae2"],

Cell["\<\
{#[\"MatchEdgePositions\"], #[\"DeletedVertices\"]} & /@ contract[path3]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"a834b5c8-49d4-004f-bbf1-4c13ac0fc19c"],

